## Approach

Add an FTS5 virtual table on `lessons.text` via a second migration, synced by triggers so `store()` needs no changes. Add a `LessonsDb::search` method that combines FTS5 text search with structured filters (category, symbol anchor, verified). Wire a new `sutra_lessons` MCP tool via the same pattern as `sutra_remember` (no workspace context needed — lessons are global).

Alternative considered: standalone FTS5 table (duplicates text). Rejected — external-content FTS5 with `content='lessons'` avoids duplication and auto-syncs via triggers. SQLite's implicit rowid works since `lessons` isn't a WITHOUT ROWID table.

