- **Create**: `src/lessons_fts5.sql` — migration SQL for FTS5 table + sync triggers
- **Modify**: `src/lessons.rs` (lines ~17, ~230+) — add migration entry, add `LessonsSearchParams` struct and `LessonsDb::search` method
